      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "WORRIED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Anyway, I guess you both have already met the new foes of this dungeon, non?",
       "transl": "Alors, ihr beide habt wahrscheinlich schon die neuen Gegner in diesem Dungeon getroffen, non?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SWEATY_SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Oh, you mean those Jellyfish?",
       "transl": "Oh, du meinst diese Quallen?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "TOWARD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I don't care about the Jellyfish, Tronny.",
       "transl": "Die Quallen sind mir egal, Tronny."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Moths.\\. They added moths.\\. And once again, they are \\c[3]huge\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Motten.\\. Es gibt hier Motten.\\. Und wieder einmal sind sie \\c[3]riesig\\c[0]."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "EXHAUSTED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "So? What about them?",
       "transl": "Und? Was ist mit denen?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "EMBARRASSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I hate bugs!\\. And those things are close enough!",
       "transl": "Ich hasse Käfer!\\. Und Motten sind fast genauso schlimm!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SHOCKED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Gosh...",
       "transl": "Божечки..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "But didn't you know that moths play an important role in our ecosystem?",
       "transl": "Aber weißt du denn nicht, wie wichtig Motten für unser Ökosystem sind?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "THOUGHTFUL"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "What?",
       "transl": "Що?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Pollinating flowers, food source for birds...",
       "transl": "Blumen bestäuben, Futter für Vögel..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "TOWARD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "They are also a great indicator for the health of the environment!",
       "transl": "Sie sind außerdem ein wichtiger Indikator für eine gesunde Umwelt!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.glasses",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "To me they are only a great indicator for places I want to leave.",
       "transl": "Für mich sind sie nur ein wichtiger Indikator für Orte, die ich wieder verlassen will."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "MOPING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "In conclusion: Moths suck! Race continues now!",
       "transl": "Oder kurz gesagt: Motten sind doof! Weiter geht's!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SHRUG"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Bye!",
       "transl": "Бувай!"
      },
